{"ts":"2026-07-04T19:15:51.772Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Charter\nLiving capability epic for observability: pm health checks, validate fix-hints, remediation registry, local telemetry stack (OTLP export, worker, Postgres/RabbitMQ/Grafana on the remote host), Sentry integration, and stats/percentiles.\n\n## Scope\n- In: health/validate/doctor advisory surfaces, remediation-registry completeness, telemetry capture levels + redaction, telemetry stats (percentiles/error-rate/agent-identity), Sentry gates in release flow.\n- Out: CI gates themselves (pm-u9d0), secrets handling policy (never write host IPs/tokens to tracked files — standing rule).\n\n## Status\n24 closed children (OTLP non-blocking queue PR#233, remediation registry PR#111/#306, Sentry trace knobs PR#303/#305, telemetry stats PR#286). Open child:\n- pm-rj3w — telemetry worker lacks Postgres reconnect; ingestion stalls after postgres restart (remote-stack fix, scripts/prod/telemetry)."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-04T19:15:51.772Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"1b6e2cb5688309575a38b957c650f81ccc9ce32f3cf86331f815f48635ca10b9","after_hash":"e75639857e87d4f21f2f2870d8658f3ad14f56ffb727afda3ae2b2c4f1550424"}
